   "titulo": "Have to do something",
   "texto": [
    "**Πρέπει να** + verb express obligation: **Πρέπει να καθαρίσω** (I have to clean). After **να**, the verb usually appears in a different form from the usual present.",
    "**Μπορώ να** means «I can.». Use **εγώ** or **εσύ** to clarify who does the task; it is often understood by the termination of the verb."
